Loop3: x[i] = x[i] + z[i]; simple elementwise, no dependencies, parallelizable over i.

Loop4: w[i] = w[i] + alpha * A[i][j] * x[j]; w[i] accumulates over j, reduction over j for each i. Similar to loop2.

